    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "A median is the middle sale price, so half the homes sold for more and half for less. Sale price versus list compares the closing price with the last list price. Neither figure says what a particular home would sell for, because condition, lot, floor plan and the strata building change the price a lot. A home evaluation from Jared uses the closest recent sales to yours, not a city average.",
